# .andromeda/ is the Andromeda pipeline's durable route / state / specs / runs — TRACKED, not ignored.
# (setup-project's first commit captures it; every wrap commits its updates; new-session reads committed state.)
# Conductor's own ephemeral PRODUCT run-artifacts (scenario journals/reports/runs.db) live at /runs/ —
# that is the separate, later ignore target (synthetic-PII-corpus journals), handled at setup/impl, NOT here.

# --- Code-graph cache (the ONE .andromeda/ exception — derived from code, rebuilt by code-graph.py) ---
/.andromeda/cache/
scripts/__pycache__/

# --- Rust (andromeda-setup-project) ---
/target/
**/*.rs.bk
*.iml
# Cargo.lock IS committed — Conductor is a binary workspace (reproducible builds + deterministic cargo-audit).

# --- Conductor run artifacts (synthetic per-run journals/reports/runs.db — generated, not tracked) ---
/runs/

# --- Secrets / env (Conductor owns no secrets — guardrail) ---
.env
.env.*

# --- Claude Code ---
.claude/backup/
.claude/settings.local.json

# --- Frontend (crates/conductor-tauri/ui — npm + Vite) ---
# package-lock.json IS committed (deterministic install + npm-audit reproducibility — mirrors Cargo.lock).
node_modules/
crates/conductor-tauri/ui/dist/

# --- Tauri (crates/conductor-tauri — tauri-build regenerates gen/schemas/ on every compile) ---
crates/conductor-tauri/gen/
